  represent the condition tensor:

  >>> sparse = tf.sparse.from_dense(float_tensor)
  >>> sparse.indices.numpy()
  array([[0, 0, 0],
         [0, 1, 1],
         [0, 2, 0],
         [0, 2, 1],
         [1, 2, 0]])

