  broadcast shape is `[3,3]`. `condition` will select columns from `x` and `y`.
  Since `y` only has one column, all columns from `y` will be identical.

  >>> tf.where([True, False, True],
  ...          x=[[1, 2, 3],
  ...             [4, 5, 6],
  ...             [7, 8, 9]],
  ...          y=[[100],
  ...             [200],
  ...             [300]]
  ... ).numpy()
