  shape is `[5, 3]`.

  >>> float_tensor = [[[0.1, 0], [0, 2.2], [3.5, 1e6]],
  ...                 [[0,   0], [0,   0], [99,    0]]]
  >>> tf.where(float_tensor).numpy()
  array([[0, 0, 0],
         [0, 1, 1],
         [0, 2, 0],
         [0, 2, 1],
         [1, 2, 0]])

